  <abstract format="text/plain" language="en" script="Latn">Recommendation ITU-T Y.4907 provides a reference architecture for blockchain-based unified key performance indicator (KPI) data management for smart sustainable cities (BKDMS). This Recommendation provides the concept, characteristics and high-level requirements of BKDMS. A reference architecture including capabilities of its functional entities is described in detail, and unified structures of KPI data are also introduced to ensure that BKDMS is realizable.</abstract>
